.moon/cache/
.vern/update-state.json
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.tanstack/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.example.tera
**/*.local
.DS_Store
# What `bun run setup` writes for an environment under deploy/: the settings
# and Secrets of a Kubernetes overlay (ZITADEL's master key among them), and
# the API's key and the local certificates of the Docker Compose stack. Back
# them up in a secret manager; deploy/README.md says which ones matter.
deploy/*/settings.env
deploy/*/generated/
deploy/*/secrets/
deploy/local/certs/

# The build output of the Cargo workspace (Cargo.toml at the root).
/target/
